==Strategy==
Two or three [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] are recommended here. On higher crown magnifications, it's recommended to use [[Carpenter Cat (Rare Cat)|Carpenter Cat]], as it can perma-stall almost every enemy here. Stall out the beginning B.B.Bunnies with [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]]. When you see the first Two Can in view, start sending out [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCats]], and try to de-sync each of them when spawned. When the Two Can is almost about to attack your Cats, block it with an [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] and start to stack [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Island Cats]], [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cats]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cats]] and if you have a high enough leveled one, [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cats]]. If you get into the first Tackey's blindspot with only a few of your cats getting hit (like one or two Manic Island Cats), then you should be fine for the remainder of the battle. If you do this right, Berserkory should be perma-frozen, so use your money from Berserkory's death to spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to speed up the rest of the stage. Keep spamming and you should win.

